Kubernetes Cost Optimization: The Silent Skill Every Engineer Needs
Most teams focus on deployments, scaling, and automation…

But very few focus on cost efficiency — until the cloud bill explodes. 
Here are 4 high-impact Kubernetes cost optimizations you can implement today:

🔹 Right-Size Your Pods
 Stop using “CPU: 1 / Memory: 2Gi” everywhere.
 Use metrics → adjust requests/limits → save $$$.

🔹 Use Pod Autoscaling Smartly
 HPA + VPA + Cluster Autoscaler = dynamic savings.
 Scale what you need, when you need it.

🔹 Clean Up Unused Resources
 Old PVCs, orphaned load balancers, unused snapshots = silent money drain.

🔹 Node Optimization
 Use Spot nodes, ARM nodes, and autoscaling nodegroups for heavy workloads.

Cloud cost ≠ just finance.
 It’s a DevOps responsibility.
 Small tweaks today = massive savings tomorrow. 💡
